    color: any non-{0,2} color (varies per puzzle, single color)
    each aligned with exactly one side strip (not diagonal quadrants)
    one marker per column (top/bottom) or per row (left/right) on its side
    distance from rect edge: >= 2 [observed]
    distributed across 2-4 sides; some sides may have 0 markers
  transform:
    for each rect column without a top/bottom marker on that side, fill bg cells from rect edge to grid edge with color 2
    for each rect row without a left/right marker on that side, fill bg cells from rect edge to grid edge with color 2
    markers and rectangle preserved; extensions only in side strips, never in corner quadrants

generation_strategy:
