0015:     Color every third black region between a red bouncing divider line yellow.
0016: 
0017:     Input structure:
0018:     - The input is a black grid split by a red line.
0019:     - The red line acts as a boundary between connected black regions.
0020:     - Regions are ordered from left to right by their bounding boxes.
0021: 
0022:     Rule:
0023:     - Find connected regions using red as the separating background.
0024:     - Sort the regions from left to right.
0025:     - Flood-fill regions with indices 0, 3, 6, and so on with yellow.
0026: 
0027:     Key insight:
0028:     - The red path partitions the grid; the fill pattern is determined by region order.
0029:     """
